uto\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(51, 102, 255);\"><strong>中興商圈走路3分鐘</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(51, 102, 255);\">免費機車停車位</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(51, 102, 255);\"><strong>生活機能佳</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">附近有便利商店、傳統市場、百貨公司、公園綠地、學校、醫療機構、夜市<br></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">3.家電傢俱齊全全新（全新4呎滑門衣櫃收納空間超大）（全新床墊及桌椅），</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(36, 106, 237);\"><strong>冷暖空調</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">冬暖夏涼，一級能效</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(51, 102, 255);\"><strong>電費超</strong></span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(51, 102, 255);\"><strong>省</strong></span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br>4.套房均備有</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(36, 106, 237);\"><strong>獨立專屬洗衣機</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">及超大</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(36, 106, 237);\"><strong>洗曬陽台</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">5.套房都有超大對外窗，</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(51, 102, 255);\"><strong>採光通風好，位置鬧中取靜</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">6.安全防火建材/煙霧警報器/檢驗合格滅火器/超大容量儲熱式安全電熱水器，</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(51, 102, 255); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong>安全＋放心</strong></span><br><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">7.獨立電表(依台電每期平均電價收取)安心透明</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">8.超大頻寬</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(36, 106, 237);\"><strong>快速網路，全Wi-FI</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">9</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">.</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(36, 106, 237);\"><strong>屋主自租，免服務費</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(51, 102, 255);\">（</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">屋主會過濾房客，鄰居均為優質住戶）</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">10.公共空間定期清掃</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">歡迎上班族&nbsp;生活單純並有正當工作者</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">（屋主會過濾房客，&nbsp;須有正當工作者可承租）</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">有意看房者請先電話聯絡&nbsp;非誠勿擾&nbsp;謝謝</span><br><br></p><p dir=\"auto\"><br></p>\r\n附近有便利商店、傳統市場、百貨公司、公園綠地、學校、醫療機構、夜市。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "汐止區福德一路300巷45號", "lat": "25.0639079", "lng": "121.6295880", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "bus", "name": "社后消防隊站", "distance": 129, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約129公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "大樹木業站", "distance": 165, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約165公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "北峰國小站", "distance": 200, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約200公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "restaurant", "name": "金圓滿熱炒", "distance": 122, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約122公尺"}, {"type": "shop", "name": "利泰白鐵工程有限公司", "distance": 100, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約100公尺"}]}, {"name": "教育", "key": "education", "children": [{"type": "primary", "name": "新北市汐止區北峰國民小學", "distance": 286, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約286公尺"}, {"type": "secondary", "name": "臺北市立東湖國民中學", "distance": 1356, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約1356公尺"}]}]}, "cost": {"title": "費用詳情", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "租金", "value": "13,000元/月", "key": "rentPrice"}, {"name": "押金", "value": "二個月", "key": "deposit"}, {"name": "租金含", "value": "管理費、水費、網路、清潔費", "key": "priceContainText"}]}, "information": {"title": "基礎資料", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "產權登記", "value": "房屋已辦產權登記", "key": "hasCertificate", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "法定用途", "value": "住家用", "key": "purpose", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "可使用面積", "value": "8坪", "key": "area", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "屋齡", "val